            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Freshly preened: Parrot 0.27.1</h3><ul><li>No report on a meeting? Write report on its Report tab makes one, Assistant on or off.</li><li>Clicking a line in a long transcript jumps there right away.</li><li>OpenRouter and other AI services are easier to find in Settings.</li><li>Parrot now tells you when an update is ready, with Restart now for the impatient.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.27.1">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
